                        "entry_id": "d9d67811-840d-39a1-bab8-7e269464e919",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An unstylish rural person; a hick."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "derogatory"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b50ac075-bb7d-4588-a4c4-53a0bb5a8297",
                                "sense_id": "c91f25f5-f45d-3bef-9450-406289fe7dd0",
                                "text": "A lot of dudes that I knew at that time use to think that guys from Maryland was bammas but I didn't sleep on nobody because even a bamma can pull a trigger. I always knew that even if a guy was from cotton ball land, he could still do damage."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8bbe1434-9091-4a7b-a688-7c6c476c30d4",
                                "sense_id": "c91f25f5-f45d-3bef-9450-406289fe7dd0",
                                "text": "Black didn't like them much. He said to me one day, “Stan, why do you hang around them bammas?” Bamma meant “country” or “slow” or something of that nature."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a19ca250-3da4-43e8-b5ee-35fa5074801a",
                                "sense_id": "c91f25f5-f45d-3bef-9450-406289fe7dd0",
                                "text": "“Man, there's a bamma that just came home from jail trying to intimidate and extort my youngins.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
